WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.999
In Settings › Profiles, each part of life has a profile of its own.

2
00:00:03.999 --> 00:00:07.399
“Work” opens in its own window, with its own colour and name.

3
00:00:07.399 --> 00:00:11.400
“Work” keeps its history, logins and cookies apart from “Personal”.
